  "css_summary": "【抽出カラー（頻度順）】\n  #C0C0C0  background-color  出現513回  [inline-style]\n  #E0E0E0  background-color  出現231回  [inline-style+external-css]\n  #F4F4F4  outline-color  出現136回  [external-css]\n  #EB0A1E  color  出現134回  [external-css]\n  #FF9999  background  出現106回  [inline-style]\n  #212121  color  出現86回  [external-css]\n  #D3D3D3  border-top  出現56回  [external-css]\n  #E3E3E3  background  出現44回  [inline-style]\n  #666666  color  出現36回  [external-css]\n  #002BB8  color  出現30回  [inline-style]\n  #F0F0F0  background-color  出現28回  [inline-style]\n  #222222  color  出現26回  [external-css]\n  #555555  color  出現25回  [inline-style+external-css]\n  #D9D9D9  background  出現22回  [external-css]\n  #008A32  background  出現19回  [inline-style]\n\n【CSS カラー変数（:root）】\n  --tjp-color-base: #fff\n  --tjp-color-primary: #000\n  --tjp-color-secondary: #f9f9f9\n  --tjp-color-tertiary: #666\n  --tjp-color-highlight: #eb0a1e\n  --tjp-color-highlight-alpha-40: rgba(235,10,30,.4)\n  --tjp-color-brand: #eb0a1e\n  --tjp-color-kinto: #00708d\n  --tjp-color-dark: #222\n  --tjp-color-gold: #ebb90a\n  --tjp-color-silver: #a5a5a5\n  --tjp-color-bronze: #c97342\n  --tjp-color-top5: #d9d9d9\n  --tjp-color-disabled: #d9d9d9\n  --tjp-color-error: #eb0a1e\n  --tjp-color-success: #3a71df\n  --tjp-color-focused: #f4f4f4\n  --tjp-color-border: #d9d9d9\n  --tjp-color-border-dark: #333\n  --tjp-color-bg-base: #fff\n  --tjp-color-bg-base-alpha-95: hsla(0,0%,100%,.95)\n  --tjp-color-bg-primary: #000\n  --tjp-color-bg-secondary: #f9f9f9\n  --tjp-color-bg-tertiary: #666\n  --tjp-color-bg-dark: #222\n  --tjp-color-bg-error: rgba(235,10,30,.1)\n  --tjp-color-bg-disabled: #f9f9f9\n  --tjp-color-text-primary: #000\n  --tjp-color-text-secondary: #222\n  --tjp-color-text-weak: #666\n  --tjp-color-text-highlight: #eb0a1e\n  --tjp-color-text-error: #eb0a1e\n  --tjp-color-text-disabled: #d9d9d9\n  --tjp-color-text-bright: #fff\n  --tjp-color-button-primary: #000\n  --tjp-color-button-primary-on: #4c4c4c\n  --tjp-color-button-secondary: #fff\n  --tjp-color-button-secondary-on: #f4f4f4\n  --tjp-color-button-tertiary: transparent\n  --tjp-color-button-tertiary-on: #f4f4f4\n  --tjp-color-chips-white: #fff\n  --tjp-color-chips-silver: #bfbfbf\n  --tjp-color-chips-red: #c30808\n  --tjp-color-chips-black: #000\n  --tjp-color-chips-brown: #70470a\n  --tjp-color-chips-yellow: #ffc700\n  --tjp-color-chips-green: #016b2c\n  --tjp-color-chips-aqua: #57a8ad\n  --tjp-color-chips-blue: #1145ab\n  --tjp-color-chips-purple: #6711ab\n  --tjp-color-outline-number-border: #d9d9d9\n  --tjp-color-marker: #cfd8dc\n\n【使用フォント】\n  monospace\n  SF Pro\n  inherit\n  sans-serif\n\n【角丸パターン】\n  50%\n  4px\n  56px\n  16px\n  3em\n  8px 8px 0 0\n  inherit\n  12px\n\n【ボタンスタイル】\n  ★ .tjp-button.tjp-button--primary（実際のボタン要素で5回使用）\n    --tjp-button-padding: 16px\n    -ms-flex-pack: center\n    -webkit-box-align: center\n    -ms-flex-align: center\n    align-items: center\n    background: none\n  ★ .tjp-button.tjp-button--tertiary（実際のボタン要素で5回使用）\n    --tjp-button-padding: 16px\n    -ms-flex-pack: center\n    -webkit-box-align: center\n    -ms-flex-align: center\n    align-items: center\n    background: none\n  ★ .tjp-button（実際のボタン要素で17回使用）\n    --tjp-button-padding: 16px\n    -ms-flex-pack: center\n    -webkit-box-align: center\n    -ms-flex-align: center\n    align-items: center\n    background: none\n  ★ .text.btn01.l-text-ellipsis.btn-text（実際のボタン要素で1回使用）\n    min-width: 100%\n    max-width: 100%\n    padding-right: 0\n    padding-left: 0\n    display: block\n    padding: 13px\n  a.btn_text\n    display: inline-block\n    min-width: 200px\n    min-height: 40px\n    padding: 8px 32px\n    border: 1px solid #212121\n    background-color: #fff\n\n【カードスタイル】\n  .tjp-grade-card__rank\n    -webkit-box-align: center\n    -ms-flex-align: center\n    -ms-flex-pack: center\n    align-items: center\n    background-color: var(--tjp-color-top5)\n    border-radius: 50%\n  .tjp-offer-kinto-card\n    background: var(--tjp-color-bg-secondary)\n    display: grid\n    padding: 24px\n  .tjp-offer-used-car-card\n    background: var(--tjp-color-bg-secondary)\n    display: grid\n    padding: 24px\n  .tjp-offer-t-connect-card\n    background: var(--tjp-color-bg-secondary)\n    display: block\n    padding: 24px\n  .global-header .global-header__feature-card\n    display: grid\n    -webkit-box-align: start\n    -ms-flex-align: start\n    align-items: start\n    -ms-flex-pack: justify\n    justify-content: space-between\n\n【フォームスタイル】\n  .tjp-frame-radiobutton__inner\n    --tjp--padding: 20px 16px\n    -ms-flex-pack: center\n    -webkit-box-align: center\n    -ms-flex-align: center\n    align-items: center\n    background-color: var(--tjp-color-button-secondary)\n  .form a.btn_text,a.btn_text.submit\n    display: inline-block\n    min-width: 200px\n    padding: 8px 16px\n    border: 0\n    background-color: #212121\n    color: #fff\n  #cboxLoadedContent input[type=button],#cboxLoadedContent input[type=reset],#cboxLoadedContent input[type=submit],#contents-body .section input[type=button],#contents-body .section input[type=reset],#contents-body .section input[type=submit]\n    height: 40px\n    padding: 0 30px\n    background-color: #555\n    border: none\n    color: #fff\n    text-align: center\n  .tjp-colorchip-checkbox\n    background-color: var(--tjp-color-base)\n    border: 1px solid var(--tjp-color-border)\n    border-radius: 50%\n    display: flex\n    height: 32px\n    width: 32px\n  .tjp-colorchip-radio\n    background-color: var(--tjp-color-base)\n    border: 1px solid var(--tjp-color-border)\n    border-radius: 50%\n    display: flex\n    height: 32px\n    width: 32px\n\n【ロゴ・ビジュアル素材】\n  https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/ff/Headquarter_of_Toyota_Motor_Corporation_3.JPG?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\n  https://ja.wikipedia.org/static/favicon/wikipedia.ico\n  https://ja.wikipedia.org/static/images/icons/wikipedia.png\n  https: